#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:111
msgid "{\\\"format\\\":\\\"pkuru-event-history\\\", ...}"
msgstr "{\\\"format\\\":\\\"pkuru-event-history\\\", ...}"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:135
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "취소"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:92
msgid "Close"
msgstr "닫기"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:143
msgid "Import"
msgstr "가져오기"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:82
msgid "Import History"
msgstr "기록 가져오기"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:48
msgid ""
"Imported matches count as already synced, and keep their original ids so "
"syncing again cannot duplicate them on the server."
msgstr ""
"가져온 경기는 이미 동기화된 것으로 처리되며 원래 ID를 유지하므로, 다시 동기화"
"해도 서버에 중복 생성되지 않습니다."

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:43
msgid "Matches to import"
msgstr "가져올 경기"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:106
msgid "Paste an exported history"
msgstr "내보낸 기록을 붙여넣으세요"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:119
msgid ""
"Rounds are placed in the timeline by their timestamps, so importing can add "
"rounds before the ones already here."
msgstr ""
"라운드는 타임스탬프에 따라 타임라인에 배치되므로, 가져오기를 하면 기존 라운"
"드 앞에 추가될 수 있습니다."

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:42
msgid "Rounds to import"
msgstr "가져올 라운드"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:46
msgid "Skipped rating adjustments"
msgstr "건너뛴 레이팅 조정"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:45
msgid "Skipped, already here"
msgstr "건너뜀, 이미 있음"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:44
msgid "Skipped, players not in this event"
msgstr "건너뜀, 이 이벤트에 없는 선수"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStateImportModal.re.mjs:126
msgid "Wait for the draw currently being generated to finish."
msgstr "현재 생성 중인 대진표가 완료될 때까지 기다리세요."
